      "moreInfoUrl": "https://credimi.io/",
      "userJourney": "Credimi integrates third-party interoperability and conformance services without making wallet developers rebuild automation for every provider. OpenID Foundation and WE BUILD test suites share one execution and evidence pipeline, while new services can be added through lightweight adapters.\n\n1. A developer connects a device running the wallet, selects a test suite and chooses an issuance or presentation flow. No test-specific code needs to be added to the wallet application.\n2. Credimi coordinates the external service, APIs and wallet actions. It drives QR-code or deep-link interactions across one or more devices and captures responses, metadata, screenshots, video, device logs and structured results. FCAF test results are extracted from these pipelines rather than produced by application-embedded test code.\n3. The developer reviews the evidence, fixes the wallet and reruns the same journey. Results can be compared across releases and test suites.\n\nKeeping the test logic in reusable automation pipelines cuts test implementation costs to a fraction of application-specific approaches and makes the automated tests reusable across wallets and assessment contexts.",
      "country": "NL"
